# 2. Configure Jenkins Slave/Agent Node for Java Maven Applications

Launch an Ubuntu 24.04 EC2 instance.

### Install Java

```bash
sudo -i

apt update -y

apt install openjdk-17-jre -y

java -version
```

### Install Git

```bash
apt install git -y

git --version
```

### Install Maven

Refer to the official Maven documentation:

[Apache Maven Installation Guide](https://maven.apache.org/install.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

```bash
apt install maven -y

mvn --version
```

